# No `version` or `date-released` on purpose: this repository has made no release yet (the first is 26.11.1),
# and the wheel version comes from the engine jar at build time, so a number written here would go stale.
# Add both when a release is cut.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ArcadeDB Python
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Arcade Data Ltd
    alias: ArcadeData
    website: "https://arcadedb.com"
  - given-names: Taewoon
    family-names: Kim
    email: taewoon@humem.ai
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2892-0194"
    affiliation: HumemAI
contact:
  - given-names: Taewoon
    family-names: Kim
    email: taewoon@humem.ai
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArcadeData/arcadedb-python"
url: "https://arcadedb.com"
abstract: Python bindings for ArcadeDB, the multi-model database (graph, document, key/value, vector and time series, queried with SQL or openCypher). The engine runs inside the Python process through JPype, and each wheel bundles its own Java runtime.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ArcadeDB
  - Python
  - Bindings
  - Embedded
  - Multi-Model
  - Graph
  - Vector
  - SQL
  - openCypher
